<title>USA: Bio-Technology files NDA for testosterone.</title>
<headline>Bio-Technology files NDA for testosterone.</headline>
<dateline>ISELIN, N.J. 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bio-Technology General Corp said Tuesday it has filed a new drug application to market its testosterone product, Androtest-SL, in the United States.</p>
<p>The company said two Phase III studies demonstrated efficacy and safety in individuals treated with Androtest-SL, which is administered sublingually, or under the tongue.</p>
</text>
